ary\", \"q\": \"Public health agencies should continue annual monitoring of adolescent vaccination coverage levels\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Healthy People 2010 targets were achieved for ≥3 doses of HepB (91.8%, CI = 90.7--92.8)\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Statistical differences in vaccination coverage were evaluated using chi square and t-tests and were considered statistically significant at p<0.05.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Estimate not reported because unweighted sample size for the denominator was <30.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"Estimate might not be reliable; CI width >20.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}